    "semanticRules": [
      "`PK(shelf_entry_id,inventory_revision,ordinal)`",
      "每个物理Material在一版Inventory中只有一row，active representation中Primary Material全局exclusive partial unique",
      "每row必须逐字保存完整`PhysicalMaterialIdentity@2` tuple，且`material_key`必须等于该tuple的canonical digest，使文件已经missing时Aftercare仍能签发精确Control release。最终物化的Related/Artifact与Primary一样必须作为Target-contained Inventory Material row，不能只保留外部Reference。Episode JSON固定`helix://contracts/application-types/ArcaMaterialEpisodeClaims/v1`、canonical JCS≤`16 KiB`且三列均非NULL，由同一On-deck Run verified `StagedInventoryManifest@1` member逐字节复制",
      "Inventory Representation与Deck Fact digest覆盖完整typed Set，历史revision从本row独立重建，不得复制多条Material row表达多个Episode",
      "`artifact_scope_json`仅Series NFO保存Arca内部`helix://arca/inventory-artifact-scope/v1` closed JCS（≤4 KiB）：schemaVersion=1、artifactKind=nfo、seasonNumber、episodeScope（整季为NULL）、requirementDigest、sourcePackageId、sourceArtifactHandleId、sourceArtifactReferenceDigest与scopeDigest。其scopeDigest覆盖除自身外完整值，Requirement由冻结Episode scope重建",
      "On-deck从Accepted Artifact与verified Staged成员关联生成，随Inventory/Deck摘要和原子事务提交，追加/维修revision逐字保留未变目标。其他角色/非Series为NULL，不得用NFO Episode Claim或文件名猜测替代此关系"
    ],
    "rawContract": {
      "columns": "`shelf_entry_id FK, inventory_revision, ordinal, material_key, role(primary_payload|structural_dependency|metadata_sidecar|poster|fanart|subtitle|external_audio|chapter|sidecar), episode_claims_schema_ref, episode_claims_json, episode_claim_set_digest, endpoint_id, location, binding_revision, mount_scope_id, inode, fingerprint_algorithm, fingerprint_version, content_fingerprint, digest_hex, size_bytes, artifact_scope_schema_ref NULL, artifact_scope_json NULL`",
      "constraints": "`PK(shelf_entry_id,inventory_revision,ordinal)`；每个物理Material在一版Inventory中只有一row，active representation中Primary Material全局exclusive partial unique；每row必须逐字保存完整`PhysicalMaterialIdentity@2` tuple，且`material_key`必须等于该tuple的canonical digest，使文件已经missing时Aftercare仍能签发精确Control release。最终物化的Related/Artifact与Primary一样必须作为Target-contained Inventory Material row，不能只保留外部Reference。Episode JSON固定`helix://contracts/application-types/ArcaMaterialEpisodeClaims/v1`、canonical JCS≤`16 KiB`且三列均非NULL，由同一On-deck Run verified `StagedInventoryManifest@1` member逐字节复制；Inventory Representation与Deck Fact digest覆盖完整typed Set，历史revision从本row独立重建，不得复制多条Material row表达多个Episode；`artifact_scope_json`仅Series NFO保存Arca内部`helix://arca/inventory-artifact-scope/v1` closed JCS（≤4 KiB）：schemaVersion=1、artifactKind=nfo、seasonNumber、episodeScope（整季为NULL）、requirementDigest、sourcePackageId、sourceArtifactHandleId、sourceArtifactReferenceDigest与scopeDigest。其scopeDigest覆盖除自身外完整值，Requirement由冻结Episode scope重建；On-deck从Accepted Artifact与verified Staged成员关联生成，随Inventory/Deck摘要和原子事务提交，追加/维修revision逐字保留未变目标。其他角色/非Series为NULL，不得用NFO Episode Claim或文件名猜测替代此关系"
    },
